.ruff_cache/

# Test output dumps written to the project root by tooling
# (e.g. r1.txt, so1.txt, df8.txt). Several were committed by mistake; they are
# regenerated on every run and are not source.
#
# Narrow on purpose. A blanket *.txt would hide the two text files that are
# part of the project: requirements.txt and the handoff note RETOMAR.md.
/*.txt
!/requirements.txt
!/RETOMAR.md
